{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented “return home to win” entirely within `game/games/lanterns`.\n\n- Lighting all 12 now enters an active `returning` phase.\n- Win occurs within 2 horizontal units of the original spawn.\n- Timer continues during the return; reaching 180 seconds loses.\n- Save/reload preserves the intermediate state and elapsed timer.\n- Added explicit return-home UI and updated win/loss messaging.\n- Existing inspection command names remain unchanged.\n- Level geometry, movement, physics, assets, and attribution were untouched.\n- Extended the ordinary-input route test to cover save/reload, timeout, and successful return.\n\nVerification passed:\n\n- `cargo test --manifest-path game/Cargo.toml -p lanterns-logic`\n- `bun game/games/lanterns/proof.mjs linux` — 0 failures\n\nKey changes: [logic/src/lib.rs](/home/ccheever/lanes/gamenext/scratch/I2/trials/7c65726/b-1/workspace/game/games/lanterns/logic/src/lib.rs:291), [app.contract](/home/ccheever/lanes/gamenext/scratch/I2/trials/7c65726/b-1/workspace/game/games/lanterns/app.contract:72), [capture.rs](/home/ccheever/lanes/gamenext/scratch/I2/trials/7c65726/b-1/workspace/game/games/lanterns/logic/tests/capture.rs:72)."}}
